{
  "scope": "Complete three-platform May RU SOCKS ResolveIP with actual Util.isIP. Exactly one external Connector.open instruction per artifact is captured; every other declaration, instruction, handler, class and resource stays unchanged. Natural SocketConnection callbacks observe actual class and receiver monitors during open/getAddress/close. Twelve hosts, five ports, twelve faults and null/non-null addresses cover early returns, exceptions/Error and cleanup; two real threads test class-lock contention on literal-IP and resolving branches. The historical static synchronized method and the source explicit class monitor retain their distinct declarations. Physical DNS/network, full SOCKS handshake and whole-program equivalence are outside this test.",
